### Description
This Terraform configuration creates a basic Amazon Kinesis Analytics Application. It includes an IAM role required for the execution of the Kinesis Analytics application. The IAM role is granted the necessary permissions to allow the application to access Kinesis data streams.

### Terraform HCL Program

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-west-2"
}

# Create an IAM role for Kinesis Analytics
resource "aws_iam_role" "kinesis_analytics_role" {
  name = "kinesis-analytics-execution-role"

  assume_role_policy = jsonencode({
    Version = "2012-10-17"
    Statement = [
      {
        Action = "sts:AssumeRole"
        Effect = "Allow"
        Principal = {
          Service = "kinesisanalytics.amazonaws.com"
        }
      },
    ]
  })

  tags = {
    Name = "KinesisAnalyticsExecutionRole"
  }
}

# Attach a policy to the IAM role
resource "aws_iam_role_policy_attachment" "kinesis_analytics_policy" {
  role       = aws_iam_role.kinesis_analytics_role.name
  policy_arn = "arn:aws:iam::aws:policy/service-role/KinesisAnalyticsForLambdaExecutionRole"
}

# Create a Kinesis Analytics Application
resource "aws_kinesis_analytics_application" "basic_kinesis_analytics_app" {
  name                   = "basic-kinesis-analytics-app"
  service_execution_role = aws_iam_role.kinesis_analytics_role.arn

  inputs {
    name_prefix = "input_stream_prefix"

    schema {
      record_columns {
        name     = "column1"
        sql_type = "VARCHAR(8)"
      }
      record_columns {
        name     = "column2"
        sql_type = "DOUBLE"
      }
      record_format {
        record_format_type = "CSV"
        mapping_parameters {
          csv_mapping_parameters {
            record_column_delimiter = ","
            record_row_delimiter    = "\n"
          }
        }
      }
    }

    kinesis_stream {
      resource_arn = "arn:aws:kinesis:us-west-2:123456789012:stream/example-kinesis-stream"
      role_arn     = aws_iam_role.kinesis_analytics_role.arn
    }
  }

  outputs {
    name = "output_stream"

    schema {
      record_format_type = "JSON"
    }

    kinesis_firehose {
      resource_arn = "arn:aws:firehose:us-west-2:123456789012:deliverystream/example-firehose-delivery-stream"
      role_arn     = aws_iam_role.kinesis_analytics_role.arn
    }
  }

  cloudwatch_logging_options {
    log_stream_arn = "arn:aws:logs:us-west-2:123456789012:log-group:/aws/kinesis-analytics/basic-kinesis-analytics-app:log-stream:example-log-stream"
    role_arn       = aws_iam_role.kinesis_analytics_role.arn
  }
}
```

### Explanation
1. **Provider Configuration**: The AWS provider is configured to use the `us-west-2` region.
2. **IAM Role**: An IAM role named `kinesis-analytics-execution-role` is created with a trust policy allowing Kinesis Analytics to assume the role.
3. **IAM Role Policy Attachment**: The `KinesisAnalyticsForLambdaExecutionRole` policy is attached to the IAM role to grant necessary permissions.
4. **Kinesis Analytics Application**: A Kinesis Analytics application is created with the specified name and service execution role. The application is configured with inputs from a Kinesis stream and outputs to a Kinesis Firehose delivery stream. CloudWatch logging options are also configured.

