This Terraform configuration sets up the required infrastructure for an AWS RDS Aurora MySQL cluster with a proxy, including VPC, subnets, security groups, IAM roles, and Secrets Manager for secure credential storage. The RDS cluster has a backup retention period of 5 days and a preferred backup window from 7 AM to 9 AM.

