4. **Lightsail Distribution**: A Lightsail distribution named `wordpress-distribution` is created to serve the WordPress instance. The distribution is configured with a small bundle (`small_1_0`) and has caching settings to optimize performance. The origin of the distribution is set to the name of the WordPress instance, ensuring that the distribution serves content from the instance.

